/w/images/thumb/2/28/Sticker_Deities_Tyr.webp/600px-Sticker_Deities_Tyr.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Symbol\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-3\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Tyr_Statue.webp\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Statue\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Tyr_Statue.webp/300px-Tyr_Statue.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Tyr_Statue.webp/300px-Tyr_Statue.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Tyr_Statue.webp/600px-Tyr_Statue.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Statue\" width=\"270\" height=\"321\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deity\">Deity</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Tyr</b>, also known as the <i>Blind God</i> and <i>Maimed God</i>, is the <a href=\"/wiki/Deities\" title=\"Deities\">god</a> of law and justice. \n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 80px; height: 80px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png/80px-Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png/120px-Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/50/Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png/80px-Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Book_Tome_S_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">And it is justice that Tyr and Torm, Helm and Hoar demand.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Gauntlet:_On_Matters_of_Law_and_Justice\" title=\"Order of the Gauntlet: On Matters of Law and Justice\">Order of the Gauntlet: On Matters of Law and Justice</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Tyr is associated with the domains of Order and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/War_Domain\" title=\"War Domain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Class_Cleric_War_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/War_Domain\" title=\"War Domain\">War</a>. This deity can be selected by a player character <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Class_Cleric_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a>.\n</p><p>Tyr was once worshiped by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anders\" title=\"Anders\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/25px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/38px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/50px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Anders\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/25px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Anders\" title=\"Anders\">Anders</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cyrel\" title=\"Cyrel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/25px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/38px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/50px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cyrel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png/25px-Portrait_Cyrel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Portrait_Cyrel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cyrel\" title=\"Cyrel\">Cyrel</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trynn\" title=\"Trynn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Trynn.png/25px-Portrait_Trynn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Trynn.png/38px-Portrait_Trynn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Trynn.png/50px-Portrait_Trynn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Trynn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Portrait_Trynn.png/25px-Portrait_Trynn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Portrait_Trynn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Trynn\" title=\"Trynn\">Trynn</a>, and an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Refugee_(The_Risen_Road)\" title=\"Refugee (The Risen Road)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png/25px-Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png/38px-Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png/50px-Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"unnamed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png/25px-Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Refugee_%28The_Risen_Road%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Refugee_(The_Risen_Road)\" title=\"Refugee (The Risen Road)\">unnamed</a> fourth companion. They eventually signed a pact with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/38px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/50px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zariel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\">Zariel</a>; who later ordered them to hunt down <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> and return her to <a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Avernus</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Items\">Related Items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammer_of_the_Just\" title=\"Hammer of the Just\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hammer_of_the_Just\" title=\"Hammer of the Just\">Hammer of the Just</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_Justice\" title=\"Sword of Justice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Sword_of_Justice_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_Justice\" title=\"Sword of Justice\">Sword of Justice</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hound_and_the_Hand\" title=\"The Hound and the Hand\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Book_Tome_W_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hound_and_the_Hand\" title=\"The Hound and the Hand\">The Hound and the Hand</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Gauntlet:_On_Matters_of_Law_and_Justice\" title=\"Order of the Gauntlet: On Matters of Law and Justice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Book_Tome_S_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Gauntlet:_On_Matters_of_Law_and_Justice\" title=\"Order of the Gauntlet: On Matters of Law and Justice\">Order of the Gauntlet: On Matters of Law and Justice</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sod_The_Maimed_God\" title=\"Sod The Maimed God\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Book_Tome_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sod_The_Maimed_God\" title=\"Sod The Maimed God\">Sod The Maimed God</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span></h2>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Your eyes glow with the fervor of one who seeks justice. You must be a priest of Tyr.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Humbletoes\" title=\"Humbletoes\">Humbletoes</a>, recognizing a cleric of Tyr</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">The Blind God rules over law and justice, encouraging valiant acts from his followers and relentlessly pursuing oathbreakers.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 252px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tyr_Icon_Original.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Tyr's symbol\"><picture><img alt=\"Tyr's symbol\" src=\"/w/images/e/e3/Tyr_Icon_Original.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Tyr_Icon_Original.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Tyr's symbol</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 323.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 321.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp/482px-Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp/724px-Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp/964px-Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp/482px-Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"322\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Jane-katsubo-tyr-statue.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<ul><li>Tyr is allied with Illmater, Torm and <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Lathander</a>, and an enemy of <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\">Bane</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>, Cyric, Mask, Talona and Talos.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tyr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tyr\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><